| `GF216Poly` | `Poly.lean` | Abbreviation `GF216[X]` — polynomials over `GF(2¹⁶)`. |
| `listToGF216Poly` | `Poly.lean` | Canonical map from `List GF16` to `GF216Poly` (ascending degree). |
| `Poly.toGF216Poly` | `Poly.lean` | Bridge from the Aeneas-extracted `Poly` to `GF216Poly`. |
