| `lagrangeScaleGF216` | `Poly.lean` | The scalar `pᵢ.y / lagrangeDenomProd` used for the i-th basis. |
| `lagrangeBasisPoly` | `Poly.lean` | The i-th Lagrange basis polynomial scaled by its `y` value. |
| `lagrangeInterpolantSum` | `Poly.lean` | `Σ_i lagrangeBasisPoly i` — the full Lagrange interpolant. |
| `hornerAccum` | `Poly.lean` | Tail accumulator `g_x · Σ_{i≥k} aᵢ·xⁱ⁻ᵏ` used by `compute_at`. |
| `expectedTrailingPoly` | `Poly.lean` | Expected state of the trailing coefficients during `lagrange_interpolate_prepare`. |

