### 2a. Pt Trait Instance Delegation Wrappers

The `Pt` ordering / equality implementations are inserted into
`Types.lean` via post-extraction tweaks (see `aeneas-config.yml`),
because the `PolyDecoder` type signature references
`Pt.Insts.CoreCmpOrd`. They perform simple `u16` comparisons on
`Pt.x.value` and contain no field arithmetic.

