### 2c. Hardware-Accelerated Functions (not extracted by Aeneas)

`src/encoding/polynomial.rs` does not itself contain SIMD-gated
functions. However, it transitively depends on the GF(2¹⁶) SIMD
dispatch (`encoding::gf::parallel_mult`, `mul2_u16`). These are
documented in [`Plan_gf`](Plan_gf) and resolved there via the
`aeneas-config.yml` body substitutions for `mul2_u16` and
`MulAssign::mul_assign`.

